    "https://jobs.montevallo.edu/postings/10471": {
      "title": "Graduate Assistant",
      "description": "University of Montevallo Applicant Portal | Graduate Assistant - CEHD Graduate Studies Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Graduate Assistant - CEHD Graduate Studies Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details To create a Posting, first complete the information on this screen, then click the Next button or select the page in the left hand navigation menu. Proceed through all sections completing all necessary information. To submit the Posting to Human Resources, you must go to the Posting Summary Page by clicking on the Next button until you reach the Posting Summary Page or select Posting Summary Page from the left navigation menu. Once a summary page appears, hover your mouse over the orange Action button for a list of possible approval step options Position Information Posting Number Job Title Graduate Assistant - CEHD Graduate Studies Department College Education Dean's Office Rate of Pay $12.00 hourly FLSA Non-Exempt Estimated Number of Hours Per Week 15 Employment Status Part Time Temporary Student Appointment Type Graduate Assistant General Description The purpose of this position is to assist in the promotion of the College of Education and Human Development’s graduate programs and the recruitment of students through content coordination of the associated communication and social media. Essential Job Duties 1. Respond to all potential students in a timely manner through assigned communication mediums, specifically electronic communication & social media. 2. Collaborate with CEHD Graduate Studies staff as well as other departments across campus to help facilitate the creation of digital content. 3. Help keep graduate student recruitment and retention materials up to date. 4. Collaborate with CEHD Graduate Studies staff to manage, clean up, and organize the electronic file structure, including advising and other office files. Other related duties as assigned. 5. 