    "https://jobs.montevallo.edu/postings/10292": {
      "title": "Summer Music & Theatre Office Assistant",
      "description": "University of Montevallo Applicant Portal | Summer Music &amp; Theatre Office Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Summer Music & Theatre Office Assistant Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details To create a Posting, first complete the information on this screen, then click the Next button or select the page in the left hand navigation menu. Proceed through all sections completing all necessary information. To submit the Posting to Human Resources, you must go to the Posting Summary Page by clicking on the Next button until you reach the Posting Summary Page or select Posting Summary Page from the left navigation menu. Once a summary page appears, hover your mouse over the orange Action button for a list of possible approval step options Position Information Posting Number Job Title Summer Music & Theatre Office Assistant Department Music Rate of Pay $8.00 hourly FLSA Non-Exempt Estimated Number of Hours Per Week Employment Status Part Time Temporary Student Appointment Type Jobship General Description Provide general administrative assistance to faculty in the Music and Theatre Department. Flexible work hours. Essential Job Duties 1. Prepare bulk mailings by printing/coping documents, preparing labels, folding letters, and stuffing envelopes. 2. Organize and file documents. 3. Assist with maintaining, retrieving and filing music collections. 4. Organize office/classroom spaces and equipment. Education and Experience High School Diploma or GED equivalent Skills, Knowledge, and Abilities 1. Must have good organization skills. 2. Ability to work independently with little or no supervision. 3. Must have an eye for detail and accuracy. Preferred Major Licenses, Certification or Registrations None Number of Vacancies Desired Start Date Open Date 05/08/2026 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Additional Statement The University of Montevallo does not discriminate ag