    "https://jobs.montevallo.edu/postings/10065": {
      "title": "Warehouse Assistant",
      "description": "University of Montevallo Applicant Portal | Warehouse Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Warehouse Assistant Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details To create a Posting, first complete the information on this screen, then click the Next button or select the page in the left hand navigation menu. Proceed through all sections completing all necessary information. To submit the Posting to Human Resources, you must go to the Posting Summary Page by clicking on the Next button until you reach the Posting Summary Page or select Posting Summary Page from the left navigation menu. Once a summary page appears, hover your mouse over the orange Action button for a list of possible approval step options Position Information Posting Number Job Title Warehouse Assistant Department Central Receiving Rate of Pay $8.50 hourly FLSA Non-Exempt Estimated Number of Hours Per Week 15 - 20 Employment Status Part Time Temporary Student Appointment Type Work-Study General Description Deliver packages across campus and assist in warehouse. Essential Job Duties 1. Receive, scan, and deliver packages. 2. Assist with stocking, and charging items in the warehouse. 3. Empty all trash, sweep floors, break down boxes, and remove wood pallets. 4. Keep delivery vehicles clean. Education and Experience High School Diploma or GED equivalent Skills, Knowledge, and Abilities 1. Must have good communication skills. 2. Ability to lift 25lbs to 50lbs. 3. Must have good decision making skills. 4. Good attention to detail and have accuracy in performing work. Preferred Major Licenses, Certification or Registrations *Drivers’ License and good driving record are required. Number of Vacancies Desired Start Date 08/20/2025 Open Date 08/13/2025 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Additional Statement The University of Montevallo does not discriminate against job applicants based on their national origin o