    "https://jobs.montevallo.edu/postings/10034": {
      "title": "Child Study Center - Preschool Teacher Assistant",
      "description": "University of Montevallo Applicant Portal | Child Study Center - Preschool Teacher Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Child Study Center - Preschool Teacher Assistant Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details To create a Posting, first complete the information on this screen, then click the Next button or select the page in the left hand navigation menu. Proceed through all sections completing all necessary information. To submit the Posting to Human Resources, you must go to the Posting Summary Page by clicking on the Next button until you reach the Posting Summary Page or select Posting Summary Page from the left navigation menu. Once a summary page appears, hover your mouse over the orange Action button for a list of possible approval step options Position Information Posting Number Job Title Child Study Center - Preschool Teacher Assistant Department Child Study Center Rate of Pay $8 hourly FLSA Non-Exempt Estimated Number of Hours Per Week Employment Status Part Time Temporary Student Appointment Type Jobship and Work-Study General Description Assistant teacher for 3- and 4-year old classrooms at the Child Study Center on campus. The Child Study Center operates Monday – Friday from 7:45 AM until 2:45 PM; August – May. Assistant teachers may be hired at various intervals throughout the academic year. Essential Job Duties Promote teacher-child relations by helping children adapt to the environment. Be familiar with and abide by NAEYC guidelines/standards. Assist with and ensure set-up/clean-up of daily routine. Assist with preparation of and service of meals and snacks. Exhibit and maintain a child-centered safe and healthy environment in both the indoor and outdoor classrooms. Complete assignments as given by the teachers and/or director. Abide by all policies stated in the Child Study Center Handbook. Complete all other tasks as needed. Education and Experience High School Diploma or GED equivalent Skills, Knowledge, and Abilities Experience with young children preferred. Selected applicants will be required to pass a criminal background check. Preferred Major Licenses, Certification or Registrations None Number of Vacancies Desired Start Date Open Date 07/29/2025 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Additional Statement The University of Montevallo does not discriminate against job applicants based on their national origin or citizenship or immigration status. Because of the costs associated with visa sponsorship/transfer, the University typically will not sponsor applicants for a work visa or transfer of an existing visa. No commitment for visa assistance and/or sponsorship can be made until a thorough search is conducted, including a proper and methodical review of all applicants. EEO Statement UM is an Equal Employment Opportunity Institution Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you currently a student (having been admitted or enrolled in classes) at the University of Montevallo? Yes No * Have you been awarded Federal Work-Study by the Financial Aid Office? Yes No Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Letter of Application Resume University of Montevallo Human Resources and Risk Management Station 6055 Will Lyman House Montevallo, AL 35115 (205) 665-6055 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
