      "description": "University of Montevallo Applicant Portal | Custodial Program Assistant Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Custodial Program Assistant Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details To create a Posting, first complete the information on this screen, then click the Next button or select the page in the left hand navigation menu. Proceed through all sections completing all necessary information. To submit the Posting to Human Resources, you must go to the Posting Summary Page by clicking on the Next button until you reach the Posting Summary Page or select Posting Summary Page from the left navigation menu. Once a summary page appears, hover your mouse over the orange Action button for a list of possible approval step options Position Information Posting Number Job Title Custodial Program Assistant Department Physical Plant Rate of Pay $8.50 hourly FLSA Non-Exempt Estimated Number of Hours Per Week Employment Status Part Time Temporary Student Appointment Type Jobship and Work-Study General Description Assist the custodial supervisor with delivery of materials across campus and perform various cleaning duties. Essential Job Duties 1. Select items from inventory per order sheets and prepare for delivery. 2. Distribute cleaning supplies including chemicals from Physical Plant to campus locations. Education and Experience High School Diploma or GED equivalent Skills, Knowledge, and Abilities 1. Capable of lifting 20 pounds comfortably. 2. Must be able to stand for extended periods and navigate stairs. 3. Ability to follow instructions and work independently. 4. Close attention to detail to accurately fulfill order requests. Preferred Major Licenses, Certification or Registrations Drivers’ license required with acceptable driving record. Number of Vacancies Desired Start Date Open Date 09/01/2026 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Additional Statement The University of Montevall